=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally on Linux + Vulkan, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nI've tried to compare real world performance by measuring the time taken to open/close https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection 50 times (with the shader cache in `user://` removed before every run), but it didn't make a difference beyond margin of error, likely for the same reason as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123319#issuecomment-5600461648. Still, it's beneficial to reduce power consumption if anything.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123319#pullrequestreview-5158015315","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123319","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-09-09T17:58:21Z"}]